  => STEP 1 PASS, both specifications.  S1599.2.25: there is no "debug tacacs+"
     command.  The 47-entry "debug ?" list shows this is deliberate and not an
     oversight, because radius, ldap and dot1x all have their own debug entry, and
     TACACS+ is the one AAA protocol without one.  That is what the TFS specifies, and
     it is why every later step in this case matters: the log is the only diagnostic
     this feature has.  S1599.1.090: "debug aaa" offers exactly accounting,
     authentication, authorization and all.

