  2026 Oct 20 01:42:07 auth.notice  sshd-session[10527]: Accepted keyboard-interactive/pam for manager from 10.38.22.33 port 55314 ssh2
  2026 Oct 20 01:42:10 auth.err     sshd-session[10527]: tac_connect_single_vrf: connection failed with 10.38.22.60:49: Transport endpoint is not connected
  2026 Oct 20 01:42:10 auth.warning sshd-session[10527]: _pam_account: error sending start (fd)
  2026 Oct 20 01:42:14 auth.err     sshd-session[10527]: tac_connect_single_vrf: connection failed with 10.38.22.60:49: Transport endpoint is not connected
